sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AG as sc-agent (sc-sync)
    participant SP as Spool SQLite
    participant RT as /api/ingest (Vercel)
    participant AUTH as token auth
    participant DB as Neon Postgres

    AG->>SP: leer lote FIFO (ventana)
    AG->>RT: POST + Bearer token + Content-Encoding gzip|zstd
    RT->>AUTH: SHA-256(token) vs devices.token_hash
    alt token invalido/revocado
        AUTH-->>AG: 401 / 403
        AG->>AG: estado needs_enrollment (spool conservado)
    else token valido
        RT->>RT: descompresion explicita (zlib / fzstd)
        RT->>RT: validacion zod (snapshot v1, limites 128/512 KB)
        alt schema invalido
            RT-->>AG: 400 validation_failed
            AG->>SP: batch -> dead_letter local
        else schema valido
            RT->>DB: INSERT flow_windows ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
            RT->>DB: INSERT alerts / agent_health / ingest_batches (ledger)
            alt conflicto UNIQUE(device_id, window_id)
                RT-->>AG: 200 {status:"duplicate"}
            else insert limpio
                RT-->>AG: 200 {status:"processed"}
            end
            AG->>SP: eliminar batch confirmado
        end
    end
    Note over AG,SP: 408/429/5xx → backoff exponencial 1-60 s + jitter
